nshu-098-jin033-wangji:head:m0268","start":268,"end":270,"surface":"魯瑤","kind":"person","person_id":"bse_0l6_t0v","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"}],"source_position":{"first_line":11,"last_line":11,"revision_id":2614273},"source_quote":{"witness":"j98","quote":"王敦，字處仲，司徒導之從父兄也。父基，治書侍御史。敦少有奇人之目，尚武帝女襄城公主，拜駙馬都尉，除太子舍人。時王愷、石崇以豪侈相尚，愷嘗置酒，敦與導俱在坐，有女伎吹笛小失聲韻，愷便驅殺之，一坐改容，敦神色自若。他日，又造愷，愷使美人行酒，以客飲不盡，輒殺之。酒至敦、導所，敦故不肯持，美人悲懼失色，而敦傲然不視。導素不能飲，恐行酒者得罪，遂勉強盡觴。導還，歎曰：「處仲若當世，心懷剛忍，非令終也。」洗馬潘滔見敦而目之曰：「處仲蜂目已露，但豺聲未振，若不噬人，亦當為人所噬。」及太子遷許昌，詔東宮官屬不得送。敦及洗馬江統、潘滔，舍人杜蕤、魯瑤等，冒禁于路側望拜流涕，時論稱之。遷給事黃門侍郎。","raw_start":226,"raw_end":521,"raw_line":11},"initial_excerpt":{"paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-098-jin033-wangji:head","start":0,"end":25,"surface":"王敦，字處仲，司徒導之從父兄也。父基，治書侍御史。"},"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-098-jin033-wangji","book_id":"b-jinshu-098","work_id":"w-jinshu","source_id":"s-jinshu-098-jin033-wangji"},{"id":"c-liangshu-043-jiangziyi:p001","text":"江子一字元貞，濟陽考城人，晉散騎常侍統之七世孫也。父法成，天監中奉朝請。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"first_line":22,"last_line":22,"raw_start":1845,"raw_end":1881,"raw_character_offsets":[1845,1846,1847,1848,1849,1850,1851,1852,1853,1854,1855,1856,1857,1858,1859,1860,1861,1862,1863,1864,1865,1866,1867,1868,1869,1870,1871,1872,1873,1874,1875,1876,1877,1878,1879,1880],"revision_id":2087360},"mentions":[{"id":"c-liangshu-043-jiangziyi:p001:m0000","start":0,"end":3,"surface":"江子一","kind":"person","person_id":"z8m_9y0_s2w_*****AA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-liangshu-043-jiangziyi:p001:m0004","start":4,"end":6,"surface":"元貞","kind":"person","person_id":"z8m_9y0_s2w_*****AA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-liangshu-043-jiangziyi:p001:m0018","start":18,"end":19,"surface":"統","kind":"person","person_id":"z8m_9y0_s2w","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-liangshu-043-jiangziyi:p001:m0026","start":26,"end":28,"surface":"法成","kind":"person","person_id":"z8m_9y0_s2w_*****A","status":"contextual_provis